			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 230338101,
					"content": "唉，這群學者的身體，真的沒問題嗎…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338102,
					"content": "學者怎麼了？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338103
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230338103,
					"content": "咳，別提了。還不是「七聖召喚」的事，那群學者成天不眠不休地研究，我真擔心「七聖召喚」的規則沒出來，他們自己的身體先垮了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338104,
					"content": "不過，他們似乎已經設計出了遊戲規則的大框架，我總算是有能參考的東西了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338105,
					"content": "我是不懂他們的工作…只能讓學者們自己努力了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338106,
					"content": "至於我嘛…還是得接著解決小說的插畫問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338107,
					"content": "#上次多虧{F#妳}{M#你}幫忙，朝霧小姐已經畫了幾張不錯的插畫。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338108,
					"content": "#旅行者，如果{F#妳}{M#你}願意幫忙的話，能再來當一次模特兒嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338109,
						230338110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338109,
					"content": "好吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338113
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230338113,
					"content": "#那做模特兒的事就拜託{F#妳}{M#你}了，旅行者。我會準備好報酬的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338114,
					"content": "我已經找到了一個不錯的取景地，就在附近。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338115,
					"content": "等我收拾一下留影機，我們就出發。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338110,
					"content": "你還要取多少材？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338111
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230338111,
					"content": "哎呀，好不容易來一趟須彌，我當然得多取一點材。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338112,
					"content": "順便…還能躲一下我的編輯…咳！",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				}
			]
		},
