					"content": "咳，別提了，還不是「七聖召喚」的事。那群學者之前不是不眠不休，把「七聖召喚」的規則給確定下來了嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338404,
					"content": "我還以為他們這下可以休息了…但沒想到，他們又開始研究了起來，說是要繼續規劃後續的設計方案…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338405,
					"content": "我是不懂他們的工作…只能讓學者們自己努力了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338406,
					"content": "至於我嘛…還是得接著解決小說的插畫問題。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338407,
					"content": "#上次多虧{F#妳}{M#你}幫忙，朝霧小姐已經畫了幾張不錯的插畫。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338408,
					"content": "#旅行者，如果{F#妳}{M#你}願意幫忙的話，能再來當一次模特兒嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338409,
						230338411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338409,
					"content": "好吧…",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338410
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230338410,
					"content": "多謝啦，我會準備好報酬的。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338414,
					"content": "我已經找到了一個不錯的取景地，就在附近。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338415,
					"content": "等我收拾一下留影機，我們就出發。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338411,
					"content": "你什麼時候回稻妻？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338412
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 230338412,
					"content": "唔…等我有了足夠的素材之後吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				},
				{
					"id": 230338413,
					"content": "這麼好的小說題材，我還想要多寫幾部呢。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						230338414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "福本"
				}
			]
